WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.640
And taking his place will be I, Ookanda Gloria!

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:11.040
As of today, I will be the headmistress of both the elementary and middle school here.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.490
What?!

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:18.870
And as such, entry to PriPara is strictly prohibited for <i>all of our students!</i>

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.750
You, you, and you right there!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.040
Lady Sophie!

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.040
Pshu...

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:29.850
This is utter chaos!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.360
What do we do, Nao?

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.800
PriPara is slipping out of my sights...

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.930
I'll get you this time, Manaka Lala!

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:43.230
It'll be fine! I have an idea.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:45.440
Idea?

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:48.670
Excuse me!

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.820
I'm here to deliver a super delicious special pizza from Papa's Pasta!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.490
Wow, those swords mean business. And they're super shiny!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.610
Hm? What's that?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.930
Just a little more... Just a little...

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.770
Alley-oop.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:50.080
What's this? An old friend ticket?

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.530
What are you doing, Manaka?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.070
Wh-What on Earth are you doing?

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:05.280
Th-This isn't what it looks like!

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.000
Then what <i>does</i> it look like?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:14.390
Headmistress, please take this pizza! Free bonus for our favorite customer!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.160
Free?

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.470
<i>All right! Even the headmistress can't stay mad after having one of our pizzas.</i>

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.810
But I can't accept it!

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:30.440
We are not allowed to accept any presents or gifts from students!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.760
Get out of my office!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.070
I won't let anyone interfere.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.330
I was so naive.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.000
This tagged along?

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.620
Hm, but this is...

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.560
This was in her office?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:57.410
A friend ticket! And an old one.

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:59.050
It was stuck on a sword?

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.510
Wow, that's a heck of a grudge she's got...

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.750
The texture and smell...

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.970
This friend ticket is from right about 20 years ago.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:11.390
Old tickets didn't have normal photos.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.100
Is that hers?

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.250
No way.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:18.180
No. I believe that is hers.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.150
Oh?

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.650
She said something that caught my attention before.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.110
<i>You couldn't clip a PriCoupon like that!</i>

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:28.790
I looked into what that referred to.

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:37.250
And I found that 20 years ago, instead of "snapping PriTickets" you "clipped PriCoupons."

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:42.090
The headmistress went to school here in Parajuku.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.110
So I visited her old school.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:48.550
And this is what I found out there.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.960
Oh!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.110
It's time!

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:05.850
Finally! Finally I've found it!

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:08.030
Manaka Lala's Friend Ticket!

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:13.120
A Friend Ticket Manaka traded to someone in our middle school!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:19.000
Now there can be no doubt she's been visiting PriPara!

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:20.490
Hm?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:27.090
Th-This is... Head Disciplinarian Minami?

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:33.270
With a change like that I can certainly see why she'd keep it a secret.

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.680
What a wonderful day! A day of victory!

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:43.150
Like a gift from the heavens!

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.300
What's all this?

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.140
It says "PriPara is the best!"

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:51.460
It's something she wrote in 5th grade.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:55.920
"I want to get to the next idol rank soon!"

00:05:55.920 --> 00:06:00.130
She had a blast herself and now she's not letting us go? What the heck?

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.500
"I don't need friends."

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.120
"I hate PriPara."

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:07.090
That's from the following year's graduation yearbook.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.080
What?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.310
How could she hate PriPara when she loved it so much before?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:17.290
So whatever made her hate PriPara happened during this time.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:21.520
I couldn't find any clues in their library as to what exactly happened.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.280
I wonder if this person knows?

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:26.830
Headmistress...

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.490
I'm taking this back!

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:34.340
And I'll ask her about what happened!

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:35.200
I'm going too!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.030
As am I.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:36.770
Me too.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:37.720
And me.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:40.420
And just what will you ask me?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.050
Headmistress!

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.820
So this is where you were hiding.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:50.840
I've been looking for you, Manaka, Minami.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.510
Or should I say SoLaMi SMILE's Lala and Mireille?

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:01.270
I finally have solid proof!

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:08.740
I see. Checking the Friend Tickets may reveal people her checks didn't catch.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:13.700
Manaka! You have been going to PriPara and lying to me!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.640
As have you, Minami.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:20.160
You, my Head Disciplinarian, have betrayed my trust!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.870
I'm sorry, Headmistress! But...

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.960
You're not wrong.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.210
And I am prepared to accept any punishment,

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:32.590
but before I do, I wish to know why!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.820
What? Where did you get that?

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.850
Manaka! You did this!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.150
I'm sorry, Headmistress!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:42.860
I was on my way to bring it back just now!

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:46.040
But we know you used to go to PriPara!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.780
Why did you start to hate it?

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.510
Why, Headmistress?

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.260
Why?

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.330
Quiet you! You children nowadays...

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.320
Why?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:52.990
Quiet you! You children nowadays...

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.770
Headmistress, please tell us.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:02.210
Sorry... I'm a bit late...

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.940
Wanted to help with weeding...

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.460
Pshu...

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.680
Sophie!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:07.920
You came to help me?

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.900
H-Houjou! What's the matter?

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:15.890
Sophie was destined for PriPara. She can't survive without it.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.320
Very well. I will tell you everything.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:26.430
When you find out the truth, even Houjou will surely give up.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:31.240
Listen well! The story behind my hatred of PriPara!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:34.320
You'll be sure to see I'm right!

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:46.560
I will never forget that day I first went to PriPara 20 years ago.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:49.650
I was 10 years old, enjoying my summer vacation.

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:54.560
Prism Stone was a much smaller store then,

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:58.910
but it was already a popular gathering spot for young girls.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:05.370
Just like today, everyone met out front and went in to see the latest trends.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:07.450
What should I wear today?

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.110
Go hamatora or go home!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.510
Check me in!

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:11.250
There.

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:15.030
- Check me in.
-There.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.460
Gossamer Girl Sugar is ready!

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.590
This is incredible!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.630
I'm finally who I was always meant to be!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:44.460
Even then PriPara was the exciting spot where all the hottest trends were born.

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:48.310
All the girly stuff you could ever want.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:56.230
There! Gah, no good?

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.340
Now! That's it, that's it!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.550
Score!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:08.420
Great success!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.220
I did it!

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:16.320
Here you go.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.510
Th-Thank you.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:24.720
I'm Himeka. Who are you?

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:28.740
I'm... Su-Sugar.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.000
Susugar?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.440
Sugar! Like, you know.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:36.560
Oh, Sugar? What a hip name!

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:39.410
I wish I'd chosen
something like that!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:44.090
And that was how I met Himeka.

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:47.200
Himeka!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:58.970
Our Lovely Twister was the perfect team.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:05.890
We shared everything, always helped and understood one other.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.830
Gotcha!

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.730
Oh, how we laughed togehter.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:24.070
A real once in a lifetime chance encounter, a true soul friend.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.000
Sugar!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.010
You're good! Wanna team up with us?

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:41.330
No way. All I need is Sugar.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.440
Right, Sugar?

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:47.140
A year and a half passed like that.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:53.480
Come chat with us at
#naisho@irc.rizon.net

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:59.440
I'm free after school tomorrow, how about we meet outside?

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.240
Sure thing!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.870
First time we'll be meeting outside, huh?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.410
I'll be waiting at the PriPara gates tomorrow.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.370
Okay! Now, let's clip some coupons!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:10.830
Yeah, clippin' time!

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.290
- Clippity clip!
- Clippity clip!

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:14.640
- Here.
- Here.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:42.030
Himeka never showed up.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.160
But I believed she would, and kept on waiting.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:12.880
I only left when my mother got worried and came to pick me up.

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:20.750
I believed Himeka must have had a very serious reason.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:27.110
And there I kept waiting for her after school the following day, and then week.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:31.630
Every single day. Rainy days. Windy days.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:39.230
But not only did I never meet her outside, she was nowhere to be found inside either.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.470
Look, there she is again.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.090
Himeka!

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.850
Come on, Lisa. She's always standing around there.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.810
It's pretty freakish.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:03.290
Only after a year of that I finally understood.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.380
I was getting fooled all along.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:13.740
Clearly Himeka had wanted to team up with someone more talented and likable.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.440
I was a fool to believe in the lie of "friendship".

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.460
Soul friend, my butt!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.880
Do you get it now?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.340
What a terrible place PriPara truly is?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:32.590
To think PriPara and friends were something so horrible all along...

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:40.060
I must become a teacher to tell everyone of the horrors of PriPara!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:44.110
And that's why I became a teacher.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:48.990
It was just one friend! That's crazy!

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.410
Crazy suits me!

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:54.720
That is a strange tale, but what does it have to do with us?

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:58.660
It's certainly sad, but I don't think your reaction is logical at all.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.040
You will all see one day.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.880
You'll come to hate PriPara one day.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:08.340
My mom said there's always some love inside hate.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.600
Huh?

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:13.990
The love inside your hate is crying.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.880
What's this nonsense?

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.270
All that's in hate is loathing.

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:22.440
I think I'd be really sad if that happened to me.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:29.050
But PriPara won't hurt anyone!

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:31.500
Himeka didn't betray you!

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.410
She must have had a reason!

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:37.430
Himeka... didn't betray me?

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:42.330
I never even considered that.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:46.040
Ridiculous! Give up already!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:46.400
Headmistress, what Lala said is absolutely true!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:47.590
Hold on a minute!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.760
Sophie.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:49.470
PriPara is nothing like you think it is!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:50.390
Here.

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:50.970
PriPara is nothing like you think it is!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:51.520
Quiet! Don't forget I have 20 years of experience!

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.150
Sorry for the wait.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:53.930
Quiet! Don't forget I have 20 years of experience!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.090
Cool your head!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.140
Cease your meddling!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.240
You're the one that's meddling!

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:00.100
Houjou, where are you going?

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.070
To PriPara.

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:04.020
Hold it!

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:08.230
Headmistress! You can take my summer vacation away!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:13.360
So let us go to PriPara! You can have my winter vacation too!

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:16.090
Watch our show!

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:20.120
We'll make you remember the love inside your hate!

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.010
I haven't watched a single one since then!

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.500
Headmistress,

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.940
I can't accept you forbidding us without even having seen for yourself!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:32.720
Please watch this time.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.300
You didn't even watch ours?

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.530
PriPara Change complete!

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:43.600
Pri!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.850
I see the situation-kuma.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.520
Let's give her the best SoLaMi show ever-kuma!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:49.690
Yeah!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.540
Mireille, say that thing.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:00.060
You know, what you said for our first show.

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.440
Say it again.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.250
Oh, <i>that.</i>

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.610
Do you like PriPara-pri?

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:06.620
Yeah!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.210
Then we'll be okay!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:12.170
So that everyone all over the world can hear us!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:14.260
Let's sing with all we've got!

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:20.690
We borrowed a television from an auditorium.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.120
The love in your hate...

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.560
Dredge it out!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.980
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.610
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.360
Coord Change Start!

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.530
Twinkle Ribbon's top seller.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.160
They all look so tasty!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.830
Pom Pom Fluffy Blend Coord!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:15.130
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.270
May they reach your heart!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.470
Our thoughts!

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.500
Lovely, lovely...

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:38.190
Exciting Present For You!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:43.750
Headmistress Ookanda?

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.740
Cyalume Change!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.160
Himeka...

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.590
Sugar... is that you?

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.130
Himeka?

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.510
Eh?

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.970
Ehh?!

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:33.760
Mom?!

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:10.950
No way! The friend our headmistress met in PriPara was my mom?

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:14.490
Will the long grudge say goodbye?

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:15.990
What's going to happen?

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:17.690
It's going to be fine.

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:20.340
It's almost Christmas, after all.

00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:23.600
Santa Claus will make our wishes true-pri!

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:25.130
Yeah! That's Right!

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:29.190
I hope we can deliver a merry Christmas to everyone.

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:32.730
Next time: Christmas Present For You!

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:35.230
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
